<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-STOCKHOLM OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STOCKHOLM OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the Stockholm Open grand prix on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat 2-Todd Martin (U.S.) 7-5 6-4 7-6 (7-0)</p>
